{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Toxic",
    "steam_appid": 3833400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/4d8f748611f0ff445fd703f8f80a1f3c.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic is a post-apocalyptic action RPG where scavengers, outlaws, and mutants fight for survival across a scorched and poisoned world. Drawing heavy inspiration from classic ARPGs, classic comic books, and the brutal vehicular chaos of combat driver games, this is an action packed, loot-heavy, open-world experience where you'll alternate between brutal shootouts and high-octane vehicular carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a shattered Earth where corrupted beasts, zombies and raiders.\u00a0 Customize your character, build and upgrade deadly vehicles, and carve a name into the wasteland one kill at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/ab72d9ecc04078b1209225329a37cc85.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Toxic takes a different approach to character design.\u00a0 Here, the player can customize your character right from the start.\u00a0 Change everything about it, the colors, the body shape, and even the clothing they will be wearing right away!\u00a0 Add extra bits to it for armor as the game progresses, but always have your character looking as tough as you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/4d8f748611f0ff445fd703f8f80a1f3c.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collapse came from the sky</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A generation ago, the world was bathed in a chemical rain that burned away the cities, choked the oceans, and awakened something unnatural deep in the earth. Civilization crumbled in months. What remains is the Deadlands \u2014 a sprawling desert filled with radioactive storms, deranged warlords, mutated humans and monstrous alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one drifting through the Deadlands, whether you seek answers, or not, you'll need to fight through blood-soaked ruins of cities once been, forge uneasy alliances, and uncover the truth behind the goo, a green jelly-like substance which has been all but replaced the natural waters of the planet. \u00a0It kind of tastes like watermelon actually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the goo, weaponize it, or push it aside. \u00a0The goo is here to stay, but are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/bf4f5f12f4b491e7a7fa60881e0dca08.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/4d8f748611f0ff445fd703f8f80a1f3c.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic is a post-apocalyptic action RPG where scavengers, outlaws, and mutants fight for survival across a scorched and poisoned world. Drawing heavy inspiration from classic ARPGs, classic comic books, and the brutal vehicular chaos of combat driver games, this is an action packed, loot-heavy, open-world experience where you'll alternate between brutal shootouts and high-octane vehicular carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a shattered Earth where corrupted beasts, zombies and raiders.\u00a0 Customize your character, build and upgrade deadly vehicles, and carve a name into the wasteland one kill at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/ab72d9ecc04078b1209225329a37cc85.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Toxic takes a different approach to character design.\u00a0 Here, the player can customize your character right from the start.\u00a0 Change everything about it, the colors, the body shape, and even the clothing they will be wearing right away!\u00a0 Add extra bits to it for armor as the game progresses, but always have your character looking as tough as you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/4d8f748611f0ff445fd703f8f80a1f3c.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collapse came from the sky</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A generation ago, the world was bathed in a chemical rain that burned away the cities, choked the oceans, and awakened something unnatural deep in the earth. Civilization crumbled in months. What remains is the Deadlands \u2014 a sprawling desert filled with radioactive storms, deranged warlords, mutated humans and monstrous alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one drifting through the Deadlands, whether you seek answers, or not, you'll need to fight through blood-soaked ruins of cities once been, forge uneasy alliances, and uncover the truth behind the goo, a green jelly-like substance which has been all but replaced the natural waters of the planet. \u00a0It kind of tastes like watermelon actually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the goo, weaponize it, or push it aside. \u00a0The goo is here to stay, but are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833400/extras/bf4f5f12f4b491e7a7fa60881e0dca08.avif?t=1751776187\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Toxic is a savage, multiplayer, loot-driven ARPG set in the blistering aftermath of the end times. Battle through toxic desert wastelands, mutated jungles and swamps, driving back hordes of zombies, mutants and ruthless raider clans \u2014 on foot and behind the wheel of heavily-armed war machines.",
